sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Agent
    participant Tsukuyomi
    participant AuditLLM
    participant Mouth as Human (Mouth)

    Agent->>Tsukuyomi: Plan: rename `process_order` (HIGH blast)
    Tsukuyomi->>AuditLLM: 5 questions about plan
    AuditLLM-->>Tsukuyomi: Round 1 answers
    Tsukuyomi->>Tsukuyomi: Validate (length, evasion, vocab)
    Note over Tsukuyomi: Round 1 FAIL: Q3 too short, evasion phrase present
    Tsukuyomi->>AuditLLM: Round 2 with feedback
    AuditLLM-->>Tsukuyomi: Round 2 answers
    Tsukuyomi->>Tsukuyomi: Validate
    alt Round 2 PASS
        Tsukuyomi->>Agent: Plan permitted (proceed to sandbox)
    else Round 2 FAIL
        Tsukuyomi->>Mouth: Escalation with full audit trail
        Mouth-->>Tsukuyomi: approve | deny | abort_all
        Tsukuyomi->>Agent: Decision applied
    end
